            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>The Test Group  progresses through the typical journey approximately 25 seconds faster than Control, primarily because of faster movement into Step 1 and from Step 3 to confirmation. The Step 1 to Step 2 transition is slightly slower in Test, while Step 2 to Step 3 takes the same median time in both groups. Transition frequency declines throughout both journeys, indicating that some users do not generate every subsequent forward transition.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
        </zone>
